    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Les humains sont arriv\xE9s dans ce syst\xE8me solaire il y a quelques
        centaines d'ann\xE9es seulement."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[2]'
      value: Ah bon? Je ne le savais pas...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[3]'
      value: "Ils sont arriv\xE9s \xE0 bord d'une fus\xE9e g\xE9ante et se sont \xE9cras\xE9s
        sur la plan\xE8te Jaker."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[4]'
      value: "S\xE9rieusement? Et d'o\xF9 est ce qu'ils venaient?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[5]'
      value: "D'une plan\xE8te tr\xE8s loin d'ici appel\xE9e la Terre."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[6]'
      value: "La fus\xE9e a voyag\xE9 pendant plus de 50 ans avant d'arriver ici."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2067207842976549832, guid: 2fd1bc5000aaa9a4a9db607666e85755, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_otherDialogues.Array.data[7]'
      value: "Ca devait \xEAtre une sacr\xE9e aventure!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
